  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.1 — 16 new features: CSV export/share, multi-column sorting, inline row editing, row grouping, multi-row selection, column drag-and-drop reorder, auto column sizing, cell alignment, extended filters (Range tab, GreaterThan/LessThan/IsNull/InSet), clipboard copy (cell + table TSV), conditional row styling, summary row aggregates (Count/Sum/Min/Max/Avg), UrlColumn, DateTimeColumn, RowNumberColumn, column resizing. No breaking changes.",
